---
description: Jest testing rules for the library source
globs: src/**/*.ts,src/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

Jest test rules. See the `Testing` section of [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) for the canonical guide.

- Every `src/**/*.ts` logic file needs a co-located `*.test.ts`.
- Every `src/components/**/*.tsx` component needs a co-located `*.test.tsx`.
- Use `@testing-library/react` + `@testing-library/user-event`. Prefer role / label queries over `data-testid`.
- Reuse fixtures from `src/test-utils/fixtures.ts` — do not inline cookie providers.
- Clean cookies between tests when asserting on `document.cookie`.
- Adding a new public export in `src/index.ts` without a test is not acceptable.
- Do not regress coverage on files you touch (Sonar tracks `coverage/lcov.info`).
